{'symbol': 'ATVI', 'date': '2022-03-29 15:02:00', 'title': 'COURT TO APPROVE ACTIVISION AGREEMENT WITH EEOC', 'text': "SANTA MONICA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THIS MORNING THE FEDERAL COURT INDICATED IT WOULD APPROVE ACTIVISION BLIZZARD'S (NASDAQ: ATVI) SETTLEMENT WITH THE EEOC TODAY. THAT SETTLEMENT PAVES THE WAY TO COMPENSATE AND MAKE AMENDS TO ELIGIBLE CLAIMANTS. “THE AGREEMENT WE REACHED WITH THE EEOC LAST YEAR REFLECTED OUR UNWAVERING COMMITMENT TO ENSURE A SAFE AND EQUITABLE WORKING ENVIRONMENT FOR ALL EMPLOYEES,” SAID ACTIVISION BLIZZARD CEO BOBBY KOTICK. “OUR GOAL IS TO MAKE ACTIVISION BLIZZARD A MODEL F"}